@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Billing disputes
+
+`classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts` classifies a message containing the lowercase text `refund` as `refund-review`. It classifies every other message, including invoice questions, as `invoice-question`.
+
+Billing classifications are routed to human review. The classification does not approve a refund, correct an invoice, or establish the outcome of a dispute. For refund and invoice questions, report the applicable classification and human-review boundary without promising a resolution.

